#: ksnapshot.cpp:95
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Press the `Grab' button, then click\n"
"on a window to grab it.\n"
"\n"
"KSnapshot is copyright Richard Moore (rich@kde.org)\n"
"and is released under LGPL\n"
"\n"
"Version: %s"
msgstr ""
"Tchôkîz sol boton `Prinde'; adon clitchîz\n"
"sol purnea ki vos è voloz ene imådje.\n"
"\n"
"Les droets d' auteurs po KSnapshot sont då Richard Moore (rich@kde.org)\n"
"Li programe est csemé dzo li LGPL\n"
"\n"
"Modeye: %s"

